# generated by test/benchmark/r5/window_probe.sh (cell -> exit-code table of the last invocation):
# disposable, never committed.  The committed per-window evidence is results/q4_window/window_meta.txt
# (window start/end, per-cell timestamps + exit codes, co-tenant samples, ETL/evogp identity, lock
# path, deviations) plus every results/**/*.log.
last_run.txt

# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.log globally, but every R5 log is evidence: it carries the
# per-cell `etl:` identity header line (git HEAD of the ETL checkout + `etl.__file__`) that labels
# which ETL checkout the record measured, plus the `gpu (before)` / `gpu (after)` co-tenant samples
# and the exact command.  Re-include them (R1-R4 force-added theirs).
!results/*.log
!results/**/*.log
